'''Slouse's Clown''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was exclusively given to [[Slouse]] by [[Nikilis]]. Slouse is the only player to own this.

== Appearance ==
The model and texture is exactly identical to the common [[Clown (Knife)|Clown Knife]].

== Trivia ==

* This item has a [[Slouse's Clown (Gun)|partner gun]] which shares the same name.
*The only differences between the two knives are that Slouse's clown's name has an orange ([[Unique Weapons|unique]]) background, instead of the normal clown's gray ([[Common Weapons|common]]).

